TI  - Lagged effect of Patient-Reported Outcomes Measurement Information System (PROMIS) Sleep Disturbance on subacute postsurgical PROMIS Pain Behavior
AU  - Highland, K.B.
AU  - Parry, J.
AU  - Kent, M.
