TI  - A Multifunctional Scaffold for Bone Infection Treatment by Delivery of microRNA Therapeutics Combined With Antimicrobial Nanoparticles
AU  - Sadowska, J.M.
AU  - Power, R.N.
AU  - Genoud, K.J.
AU  - Matheson, A.
AU  - González-Vázquez, A.
AU  - Costard, L.
