TI  - The Academician N. N. Blokhin as the founder, the director and the scientific director of the Gorky Research Institute of Restorative Surgery, Traumatology and Orthopedics in the postwar years
AU  - Koshelev, A.D.
AU  - Serebryany, R.S.
