TI  - Self-Tandem Bio-Heterojunctions Empower Orthopedic Implants with Amplified Chemo-Photodynamic Anti-Pathogenic Therapy and Boosted Diabetic Osseointegration
AU  - Shu, R.
AU  - Sun, J.
AU  - Li, B.
AU  - Gao, X.
