TI  - Does Treating Low Back Pain With Therapeutic Exercise Reduce the Risk of Subsequent Lower Extremity Injury? A Population-Level Cohort Analysis
AU  - Foster, K.
AU  - Wang-Price, S.
AU  - Weber, M.
AU  - Brizzolara, K.
AU  - Yuan, X.
AU  - Boeth, R.
AU  - Rhon, D.I.
