TI  - Biocomposites containing poly(lactic acid) and chitosan for 3D printing – Assessment of mechanical, antibacterial and in vitro biodegradability properties
AU  - Hui, I.
AU  - Pasquier, E.
AU  - Solberg, A.
AU  - Agrenius, K.
AU  - Håkansson, J.
AU  - Chinga-Carrasco, G.
