TI  - Utility of preinduction tests as predictors of attrition in infantry recruits: A prospective study
AU  - Fleischmann, C.
AU  - Yanovich, R.
AU  - Milgrom, C.
AU  - Eliyahu, U.
AU  - Gez, H.
AU  - Heled, Y.
AU  - Finestone, A.S.
PY  - 2023
