TI  - Proximity matters: Assessing vascular injury and surgical decision-making in penetrating neck trauma
AU  - Dudkiewicz, D.
AU  - Tsur, N.
AU  - Yosefof, E.
AU  - Shpitzer, T.
AU  - Mizrachi, A.
AU  - Yehuda, M.
AU  - Bachar, G.
AU  - Yaniv, D.
PY  - 2025
