TI  - The role of a saline coupled bipolar sealant to reduce blood loss in anterior total hip arthroplasty
AU  - Coory, J.
AU  - Wagh, Y.
AU  - Munir, S.
AU  - Grayson, J.
AU  - Rodda, D.
