TI  - Astaxanthin Prevents Glucocorticoid-Induced Femoral Head Osteonecrosis by Targeting Ferroptosis through the JAK2/STAT3 Signaling Pathway
AU  - Lin, Y.-Z.
AU  - Chen, Z.-H.
AU  - Yang, J.-F.
AU  - Han, L.-J.
AU  - Yu, Y.-T.
