TI  - Conducting Pre-deployment Training in Honduras: The 240th Forward Resuscitative Surgical Team Experience
AU  - Huh, J.
AU  - Brockmeyer, J.R.
AU  - Bertsch, S.R.
AU  - Vanderspurt, C.
AU  - Batig, T.S.
AU  - Clemens, M.
