TI  - A novel hospital capacity versus clinical justification triage score (CCTS) for prioritization of spinal surgeries in the “new normal state" of the COVID-19 pandemic
AU  - Liu, G.
AU  - Tan, J.-H.
AU  - Hey, H.W.D.
AU  - Lau, L.L.
