TI  - The historical background of plaster cast (In honor of Dr. Mohammad-Taghi Mir, Shiraz university of medical sciences)
AU  - Raoufi, M.
AU  - Abedtash, H.
AU  - Mohagheghzadeh, A.
PY  - 2017
