TI  - Post-traumatic osteomyelitis in Middle East war-wounded civilians: Resistance to first-line antibiotics in selected bacteria over the decade 2006-2016
AU  - Fily, F.
AU  - Ronat, J.-B.
AU  - Malou, N.
