TI  - Pain, Depression, and Posttraumatic Stress Disorder following Major Extremity Trauma among United States Military Serving in Iraq and Afghanistan: Results from the Military Extremity Trauma and Amputation/Limb Salvage Study
AU  - Castillo, R.C.
AU  - Carlini, A.R.
AU  - Doukas, W.C.
AU  - Hayda, R.A.
AU  - Frisch, H.M.
AU  - Andersen, R.C.
