TI  - Antibacterial Surface Design of Titanium-Based Biomaterials for Enhanced Bacteria-Killing and Cell-Assisting Functions Against Periprosthetic Joint Infection
AU  - Wang, J.
AU  - Li, J.
AU  - Qian, S.
AU  - Guo, G.
AU  - Wang, Q.
AU  - Tang, J.
AU  - Shen, H.
