TI  - Risk factors for decreased range of motion and poor outcomes in open periarticular elbow fractures
AU  - Dickens, J.F.
AU  - Wilson, K.W.
AU  - Tintle, S.M.
AU  - Heckert, R.
AU  - Gordon, W.T.
AU  - D'Alleyrand, J.-C.G.
