TI  - Outcomes following limb salvage after combat hindfoot injury are inferior to delayed amputation at five years
AU  - Bennett, P.M.
AU  - Stevenson, T.
AU  - Sargeant, I.D.
AU  - Mountain, A.
AU  - Penn-Barwell, J.G.
PY  - 2018
