TI  - Open, combat-related loss, or disruption of the knee extensor mechanism: Treatment strategies, classification, and outcomes
AU  - Andersen, R.C.
AU  - Wilson, K.W.
AU  - Bojescul, J.A.
AU  - Mickel, T.J.
AU  - Gordon, W.T.
AU  - Potter, B.K.
PY  - 2014
