TI  - Orthopaedic management in a mega mass casualty situation. the Israel Defence Forces Field Hospital in Haiti following the January 2010 earthquake
AU  - Bar-On, E.
AU  - Lebel, E.
AU  - Kreiss, Y.
AU  - Merin, O.
AU  - Benedict, S.
