TI  - Effects of different sterilization techniques and varying anodized TiO 2 nanotube dimensions on bacteria growth
AU  - Kummer, K.M.
AU  - Taylor, E.N.
AU  - Durmas, N.G.
AU  - Tarquinio, K.M.
AU  - Ercan, B.
AU  - Webster, T.J.
